      "source": { "kind": "site", "page": "getting_to_know.html", "file": "MQF - 2/Lesson 04/djalogu.pdf, page 1" },
      "editorialMethod": "Short editorial conversation combining clear S11 job-search phrases (analysis section 10) with S05 reunion phrases (section 6, G10 and G05). The cook's reply is adapted to avoid the defective source sentence. This is not a full transcription or a teacher-certified answer key; English translations are editorial.",
